<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-TRAVERSONI WINS 19TH TOUR STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TRAVERSONI WINS 19TH TOUR STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>DIJON, France 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mario Traversoni of Italy won the 19th stage of the Tour de France over 172 km from Montbeliard on Friday.</p>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany retained the overall lead.</p>
</text>
